{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobiM6bU5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "42ndシングル「是非に及ばず」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日発売です！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVはこちら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ogAufBgPpBk"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今シングルに収録される楽曲たち🎶"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://nogizaka46.lnk.to/Zehinioyobazu_SE"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非に及ばず"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "告白したい病"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Kissのタイミング"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3曲参加させて頂いてます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "収録曲全てジャンルが違う楽曲が揃っていますので色んな乃木坂ちゃんを楽しんでほしいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日、42ndシングルヒット祈願生配信をさせて頂きました！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobX9oyld.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アーカイブ🤘🏻"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtube.com/live/LdQVsn8C57c"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "水戸葵陵高等学校の書道部の皆様！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして先生方！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご協力ありがとうございました😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "青春だったな〜"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "書道部の方々のパフォーマンスに懸ける熱量にとても刺激を受けました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一発勝負、痺れましたねとても"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何にも代えがたい大切な時間でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見届けてくださった皆様もありがとうございます🙇🏻‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "完全版も後日アップされますのでお楽しみに🪄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そし